        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWGVCCOM, Newport Grande Victorian Knob Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe fancy styling of the Single Cylinder Newport Grande Victorian Egg Knobset makes it both a standout and a standard in decorative door hardware. The Grande Victorian Knob is a prime example of tasteful elegance. It has a stately look without being gaudy. The Georgetown's Rosette design combined with the ornate egg shaped Grande Victorian Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the beautiful finish choices. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Newport Rosette with Grande Victorian Knob and matching deadbolt fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. It is easy to install and comes backed by a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWGVCCOM Single Cylinder Newport Grande Victorian Egg Knobset:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newport Grande Victorian Knob Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Width: 1.64\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GVC-knob.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Grande Victorian Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NEW-rose.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Newport Rosette Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/NEW-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Newport Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
